/buck-out/
/.buckconfig.local
# zig's cache of a local C/C++ compile (tools/build/mojo/tools/zig_cc_launcher.zig).
/.zig-cache/
# The staged set the release workflow writes with `mopm stage` (release/staged_set/BUCK).
/release/staged_set/*
!/release/staged_set/BUCK
# A private list of words the public boundary lint refuses (root BUCK,
# public_boundary): kept by the repository that passes it, never here.
/.public_boundary_deny
# The beta set the job `mopm-e2e-beta` downloads (release/beta_set/BUCK).
/release/beta_set/*
!/release/beta_set/BUCK
